%9Setting:%9

    show_names_on_join_alone (boolean; default: ON, the Shellter default
    configuration sets OFF)

%9Description:%9

    Prints the table of nicks when you join a channel you are alone on.

    A table with only your own nick says nothing, so with the setting OFF
    such a join prints only the count line ("Total of 1 nicks ...").
    Channels with other people are not affected; for them
    show_names_on_join_limit decides.

    Nothing is printed when show_names_on_join is OFF. The list can always
    be printed with /NAMES.

%9Examples:%9

    /SET show_names_on_join_alone on
    /SET show_names_on_join_alone off

%9See also:%9

    SET, NAMES, SHOW_NAMES_ON_JOIN, SHOW_NAMES_ON_JOIN_LIMIT
